        "command": "name",
        "value": "Inam",
        "text": "She's been learning Sargonian and what life in the outside world is like. After I taught her the basics, of course."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_337_utage_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_075",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Utage",
        "text": "Hm, I can't imagine these books help much with her Sargonian."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_337_utage_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_075",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Inam",
        "text": "You're right. But that's really how she learned it. Letter by letter, word by word."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Inam",
        "text": "It may not be the best material to learn from, but it was more painful to see her not having a clue where to start."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Inam",
        "text": "That's also why I decided to teach her Sargonian."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_075",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Inam",
        "text": "You know, Gavial, she's really working hard to get to where you are."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_075",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gavial",
        "text": "...You don't need to tell me. I know."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_075",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Inam",
        "text": "But well, I don't know that much about what it's like outside either. Besides, I can only bring so many books with me, so I don't really know whether she's learning anything useful from them, haha."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_075",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gavial",
        "text": "...No wonder there's always something weird about her."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gavial",
        "text": "Hang on, don't tell me you're the one who taught Zumama Sargonian too."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_075",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Inam",
        "text": "Nope. I'm pretty curious about that myself. She did have me find her books on machinery, but it was like she just picked up Sargonian out of nowhere."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Inam",
        "text": "And she's even teaching it to her tribe."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_187_ccheal_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gavial",
        "text": "...Doctor, what do you think?"
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "She's quite ambitious.;......;How much for this rock?",
            "values": "1;2;3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_187_ccheal_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gavial",
        "text": "You think so too, huh?"
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_187_ccheal_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gavial",
        "text": "You want me to think about it myself, huh?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gavial",
        "text": "Hm, alright. I'll settle this my way."
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 3
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_075"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Inam",
        "text": "Since you're a new customer, I'll let you have it for 300 dinar."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_337_utage_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Utage",
        "text": "That's the look of a Doctor who just doesn't care."
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": "1;2;3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_201_moeshd"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Croissant",
        "text": "Eh? T'ain't nothin' wrong with her teachin' Sargonian. If'n people here could talk with folks out there, they'd live a lot better."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_075",
            "name2": "char_201_moeshd",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Inam",
        "text": "Maybe. The way I think about it, compared to your supposedly much better lives, I think our way of life out here is satisfying enough."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Inam",
        "text": "I don't think you city folks would understand, though."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_075",
            "name2": "char_201_moeshd#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Croissant",
        "text": "That so...?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_337_utage_1",
            "name2": "char_201_moeshd",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Utage",
        "text": "Oh, I think I get it! I mean, I lived in the countryside back in Higashi, too."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_337_utage_1",
            "name2": "char_201_moeshd",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Croissant",
        "text": "Eh? I took you for a city girl, what with how trendy you are."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_337_utage_1",
            "name2": "char_201_moeshd",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Utage",
        "text": "Nope, this is just the kinda stuff I like."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_075"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Inam",
        "text": "*Yawn*... I'm tired... time for a nap."
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
            "volume": 0.6
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
